 <string name="settings_note">Settings, favourites, modules and calculator values are saved on this device.</string>
 <string name="mono_accessibility">NE555: pins 8 and 4 to supply, 1 to ground; RA from supply to pins 6 and 7; capacitor from pins 6 and 7 to ground; trigger pin 2 pulsed low, output pin 3. Pin 5 bypass to ground.</string>
 <string name="astable_accessibility">NE555: pins 8 and 4 to supply, 1 to ground. RA supply to pin 7; RB pin 7 to joined pins 2 and 6; timing capacitor to ground; output pin 3; pin 5 bypass capacitor to ground.</string>
 <string name="transformation_accessibility">Star: three resistors meet at a common centre. Delta: three resistors form the sides of a triangle between A, B and C.</string>
 <string name="info_body">ELECTRO\n\nAn offline-first electrical and electronics toolkit with calculators, pin-outs and detailed learning lessons. No advertising or account. Internet is used only for optional official GitHub update checks.\n\nVersion %1$s\n\nConfirm exact parts and ratings with the manufacturer.</string>
 <string name="credits_body">Designed and authored for Electro.\n\nKotlin and kotlinx.serialization — JetBrains (Apache 2.0).\nAndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, Navigation, Lifecycle, DataStore — Android Open Source Project (Apache 2.0).\nMaterial Icons — Google (Apache 2.0).\nJUnit 4 — EPL 1.0.\nGradle wrapper — Apache 2.0.\n\nComponent names identify manufacturers’ parts and remain their respective owners’ marks. Dataset descriptions, circuit motifs and connector drawings are original. Reference URLs are listed on relevant pages and in SOURCES.md; browsing is not required by the app.</string>
 <string name="changes_body">%1$s • ELECTRO Maintenance Update\n\nUpdate APK files download directly inside ELECTRO with visible progress, integrity checks, and the Android install confirmation. No browser redirect is required. All existing tools and saved data remain.</string>
